      "text": "#WxHistory |\n[🧵] Typhoon Goni '20 (Rolly) became the most powerful landfalling TC on record, hitting the Philippines w/ winds up to 195mph & a pressure of 884mb. The impacts to Catanduanes was catastrophic. Extreme winds & storm surge destroyed numerous buildings & homes. Shelters were no match for Goni's winds as it blew the roofs off the buildings. \n\nLater on, Goni worsened the impacts to the flooding the occurred in Vietnam during the autumn. \n\nGoni was responsible for killing 32 & dealing over $1B in damages. Both Goni & Rolly were retired & replaced w/ Gaenari & Romina respectively. \n[1/2]",
